{"id":"vod_zy360_67721","vodId":"67721","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"境界的彼方","name_cn":"境界的彼方","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241106-1/b2adeafb81911f95582f21cfa294099a.jpg"},"summary":"这个世界上存在着异形之物，其姿态千变万化，即为“妖梦”，以除去妖梦为业的，即为异界士。本作主人公神原秋人（KENN配音），看起来是个普通的高二男生，实际上是由人类和妖梦结合而诞生的“半妖”。拥有不死之身的他，于某个黄昏，在校园天台遇见一名想要跳楼的少女栗山未来（种田梨纱配音），出乎意料的是，少女居然对他发起了攻击。原来，看起来是个普通新生的眼镜美少女，竟是一名能够操纵血的异界士。拥有特殊能力的栗山未来，引起了异界士名门望族名濑家的注意。与秋人同为文艺部的名濑美月（茅原实里配音）即是名濑家的次女，她嘱咐秋人远离栗山。肆虐的妖梦，孤独行走于世的异界士，以及罕有的半妖，在境界的彼方展开一个奇异的幻想故事。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-11-06 14:37:58","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/hI9IITaD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/4rh3NlXX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/Dvj1iIT8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/OenLkglv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/YE3jRgKY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/vB1xcsPe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/Smdfrk6k/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/9oifGYiv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/W3tPenPG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/pkQhpUkN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/WyWcDB6e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/1WcgVc4S/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:43:29.640Z"}